ow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math>","exercise":null},{"key":"most_of_the_unstated_remainder_stays_inside_one_wing","name":"CLAIMED: of 98717 unstated crosses, 43796 join integers no single wing carries all three of — over two fifths and under a half, since 43796 × 5 > 98717 × 2 and 43796 × 2 < 98717.","statement":"((43796 * 5 > 98717 * 2) ∧ (43796 * 2 < 98717)) ∧ (43796 < 98717)","address":"9668ade2-fed8-8665-aeec-e70f2683e184","skill":"cross-formulas","tex":"43796 \\cdot 5 > 98717 \\cdot 2 \\quad\\land\\quad 43796 \\cdot 2 < 98717 \\quad\\land\\quad 43796 < 98717","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>43796</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>98717</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mrow><mn>43796</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>98717</mn></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mn>43796</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>98717</mn></mrow></mrow></math>","exercise":null},{"key":"the_same_arithmetic_answers_more_than_one_domain","name":"CLAIMED: 1532 formula-shaped statements carry 1460 distinct byte-strings and 1327 distinct algebraic forms, so 205 statements restate a form another already holds — and those split 129 copies against 15 crosses, the widest cross spanning 3 wings. Most repetition is waste; a small part of it is a bridge.","statement":"((1327 < 1460) ∧ (1532 - 1327 = 205)) ∧ ((129 > 8 * 15) ∧ (3 > 2))","address":"31c4d0a7-a4f8-87e9-9268-73d8b1097004","skill":"cross-formulas","tex":"1327 < 1460 \\quad\\land\\quad 1532 - 1327 = 205 \\quad\\land\\quad 129 > 8 \\cdot 15 \